*.dmg
*.zip
VPNRouter-v*.zip
VPNRouter-v*.dmg
VPNRouter-v*.sha256
VPNRouter-install-*.zip
VPNRouter-update-*.zip
VPNRouter-update-v*.sha256
b_icon.png
w_icon.png
publish/

# Draft release-notes files — rendered into `gh release --notes-file`, not
